-1. **Initialization**: Set the starting position $(x, y, z)$ based on spherical coordinates:
-   $$
-   x = r_{start} \sin(\theta_0) \cos(\phi_0)
-   $$
-   $$
-   y = r_{start} \sin(\theta_0) \sin(\phi_0)
